<title>USA: Taro sees higher profitability in 1997.</title>
<headline>Taro sees higher profitability in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>HAWTHORNE, N.Y. 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taro Pharmaceutical Industries Inc said Thursday it will increase profitability in 1997 while supporting all aspects of its research and development program.</p>
<p>The company did not say how much it would spend on R&amp;D in 1997. Company officials were not available for comment.</p>
<p>Taro also said it expects to maintain its rate of Abbreviated New Drug Application (ANDA) filings in 1997. The company submitted seven such filings in 1996 and one last month.</p>
